WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.434 --> 00:00:02.601
-Welcome, everybody.
Welcome, welcome, welcome.

00:00:02.601 --> 00:00:04.868
Welcome to
"The Tonight Show," everyone.

00:00:04.868 --> 00:00:06.000
You're here.
You made it.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:07.901
Thank you very much
for being here, hey.

00:00:07.901 --> 00:00:12.067
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:12.067 --> 00:00:13.901
Well, guys,
I can't believe this.

00:00:13.901 --> 00:00:16.767
Today is the iPhone's
15th birthday.

00:00:16.767 --> 00:00:18.400
Today.
[ Cheers ]

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:20.701
Which means right now,
Nokia is in a bar somewhere

00:00:20.701 --> 00:00:23.968
going, "15 years ago,
I was on top of the world."

00:00:23.968 --> 00:00:25.667
[ Laughter ]

00:00:25.667 --> 00:00:27.667
"You can't throw me out.
I'll throw you out."

00:00:27.667 --> 00:00:28.934
[ Laughter ]

00:00:28.934 --> 00:00:30.567
Yeah, I can't believe
it's been 15 years

00:00:30.567 --> 00:00:33.434
since Apple revolutionized
the way we raise our kids.

00:00:33.434 --> 00:00:34.601
[ Laughter ]

00:00:34.601 --> 00:00:36.667
"Just -- Just take that."
Yeah, that's right.

00:00:36.667 --> 00:00:39.534
The iPhone is so popular,
it single-handedly turned Apple

00:00:39.534 --> 00:00:41.734
and rice
into a trillion-dollar industry.

00:00:41.734 --> 00:00:43.367
[ Laughter ]

00:00:43.367 --> 00:00:46.033
Speaking of Apple,
the FCC has asked Apple

00:00:46.033 --> 00:00:48.734
and Google to remove TikTok
from their app stores

00:00:48.734 --> 00:00:51.200
over national-security concerns.

00:00:51.200 --> 00:00:53.100
[ Audience "Oohs" ]

00:00:53.100 --> 00:00:54.934
Then Apple and Google
saw how much money

00:00:54.934 --> 00:00:57.000
they were making off TikTok
and told the FCC

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:58.534
to go FCC themselves.

00:00:58.534 --> 00:01:04.033
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:04.033 --> 00:01:05.968
Yeah, they claim China
has been stealing

00:01:05.968 --> 00:01:08.501
sensitive user data
through the app.

00:01:08.501 --> 00:01:11.033
Apparently, they got suspicious
when Chinese engineers

00:01:11.033 --> 00:01:13.100
started slapping each other
with tortillas.

00:01:13.100 --> 00:01:15.834
[ Laughter ]

00:01:15.834 --> 00:01:17.701
Pwff!

00:01:17.701 --> 00:01:20.167
Yeah, the FCC was like,
"The risk is too great.

00:01:20.167 --> 00:01:22.767
Putin might learn
how we make pasta in a mug."

00:01:22.767 --> 00:01:24.300
[ Laughter ]

00:01:24.300 --> 00:01:26.734
Meanwhile, they heard that they
can be removed from the app,

00:01:26.734 --> 00:01:28.000
TikTok was like --

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:29.367
-♪ Oh, no ♪

00:01:29.367 --> 00:01:30.734
♪ Oh, no ♪
[ Laughter ]

00:01:30.734 --> 00:01:33.534
♪ Oh, no, no, no, no, no ♪

00:01:33.534 --> 00:01:38.367
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:38.367 --> 00:01:42.968
♪♪

00:01:42.968 --> 00:01:45.267
-People are still talking about
yesterday's bombshell hearing

00:01:45.267 --> 00:01:46.968
about former President Trump.

00:01:46.968 --> 00:01:49.667
We heard that, at one time,
Trump got so angry

00:01:49.667 --> 00:01:51.567
that he threw his plate
at the wall

00:01:51.567 --> 00:01:54.000
and that he got ketchup
all over the place.

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:56.868
And apparently,
it's inspired a new product.

00:01:56.868 --> 00:01:58.133
Watch this.

00:01:58.133 --> 00:02:00.534
-Say goodbye to messy cleanups

00:02:00.534 --> 00:02:03.567
and hello to
the Trump Magic Eraser.

00:02:03.567 --> 00:02:05.934
The best way
to clean food off your walls,

00:02:05.934 --> 00:02:07.801
like a steak with ketchup.

00:02:07.801 --> 00:02:08.734
[ Crashing ]

00:02:08.734 --> 00:02:10.067
Or spaghetti with ketchup.

00:02:10.067 --> 00:02:11.133
[ Crashing ]

00:02:11.133 --> 00:02:12.968
Even chili cheese dogs
with ketchup.

00:02:12.968 --> 00:02:14.100
[ Splats ]

00:02:14.100 --> 00:02:16.801
The Trump Magic Eraser
wipes it all away.

00:02:16.801 --> 00:02:18.634
And best of all,
when you're done,

00:02:18.634 --> 00:02:21.634
you can flush it down the toilet
like a classified document.

00:02:21.634 --> 00:02:22.667
-Bye-bye.

00:02:22.667 --> 00:02:24.033
-The Trump Magic Eraser.

00:02:24.033 --> 00:02:26.234
A-a-a-and he's getting sued
by Mr. Clean.

00:02:26.234 --> 00:02:27.467
-I just thought
that was interesting.

00:02:27.467 --> 00:02:29.133
That's an interesting
commercial.

00:02:29.133 --> 00:02:33.067
[ Applause ]

00:02:33.067 --> 00:02:34.968
Well, guys,
it's been a tough couple of days

00:02:34.968 --> 00:02:36.334
for the Giuliani family.

00:02:36.334 --> 00:02:38.467
First, Rudy Giuliani -- I don't
know if you heard this --

00:02:38.467 --> 00:02:41.267
he claimed that he was assaulted
at a grocery store.

00:02:41.267 --> 00:02:43.100
But security footage
showed that it was

00:02:43.100 --> 00:02:45.367
more of a pat on his back.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:45.367 --> 00:02:48.100
And then, last night,
Rudy's son, Andrew Giuliani,

00:02:48.100 --> 00:02:51.400
lost the Republican primary
for New York governor.

00:02:51.400 --> 00:02:54.234
Yeah. His biggest weakness?
Name recognition.

00:02:54.234 --> 00:02:57.300
[ Laughter ]

00:02:57.300 --> 00:02:58.767
It was a tough night for Andrew.

00:02:58.767 --> 00:02:59.834
He gave his dad a big hug,

00:02:59.834 --> 00:03:01.567
and then Rudy accused him
of assault.

00:03:01.567 --> 00:03:03.367
[ Laughter ]

00:03:03.367 --> 00:03:05.634
Did you guys see this?
I read that Nissan

00:03:05.634 --> 00:03:09.033
is recalling more than 300,000
Pathfinders

00:03:09.033 --> 00:03:12.133
over risk of the hoods flying
open while people are driving.

00:03:12.133 --> 00:03:14.634
[ Laughter ]

00:03:14.634 --> 00:03:17.467
Turns out Nissan was using
the term Pathfinder ironically.

00:03:17.467 --> 00:03:20.767
[ Laughter ]

00:03:20.767 --> 00:03:22.834
Speaking of cars,
due to high gas prices,

00:03:22.834 --> 00:03:25.167
fewer Americans are going
on summer road trips.

00:03:25.167 --> 00:03:26.567
But just 'cause
you're staying at home

00:03:26.567 --> 00:03:28.467
doesn't mean you can't feel
like you're on a road trip.

00:03:28.467 --> 00:03:29.634
So I thought I'd share
some of my

00:03:29.634 --> 00:03:32.067
home road-trip tips right here.

00:03:32.067 --> 00:03:33.334
First, every half-hour,

00:03:33.334 --> 00:03:35.934
randomly point somewhere
in the room and say, "Cow."

00:03:35.934 --> 00:03:37.934
[ Laughter ]

00:03:37.934 --> 00:03:41.567
Next, use your own bathroom
but flush with your foot.

00:03:41.567 --> 00:03:44.067
[ Laughter ]

00:03:44.067 --> 00:03:46.167
And, finally, have your kid
sit on the couch

00:03:46.167 --> 00:03:48.133
and threaten to turn
this whole house around.

00:03:48.133 --> 00:03:49.200
"We're going --
We're taking --

00:03:49.200 --> 00:03:50.534
I'm gonna take
the whole house back."

00:03:50.534 --> 00:03:51.701
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:51.701 --> 00:03:55.868
It's just like the real thing.

00:03:55.868 --> 00:03:58.234
Hey, guys, listen to this.
Whole Foods said that,

00:03:58.234 --> 00:04:00.267
as the pandemic eases,
they're focused

00:04:00.267 --> 00:04:03.267
on holding down prices
for their customers.

00:04:03.267 --> 00:04:06.067
It's true. Take a look at this
commercial they just released.

00:04:06.067 --> 00:04:08.400
-We here at Whole Foods
are committed to our customers

00:04:08.400 --> 00:04:11.200
and will continue selling our
products at reasonable prices,

00:04:11.200 --> 00:04:13.601
like a bunch of bananas
for just $14.99.

00:04:13.601 --> 00:04:16.000
[ Laughter ]
Apples for just $9.99 a pound.

00:04:16.000 --> 00:04:17.801
That's cheaper
than a gallon of gas.

00:04:17.801 --> 00:04:22.033
And this ripe avocado that costs
just 3 easy payments of $99.99,

00:04:22.033 --> 00:04:23.834
a $200 down payment,
a security deposit,

00:04:23.834 --> 00:04:25.834
and your firstborn child,
plus shipping and handling.

00:04:25.834 --> 00:04:28.467
Whole Foods --
Stay in your lane, Erewhon!

00:04:28.467 --> 00:04:29.934
-Oh, interesting, wow.
[ Laughter ]

00:04:29.934 --> 00:04:34.567
[ Applause ]

00:04:34.567 --> 00:04:36.934
Well, some TV news.
NBC is coming out with

00:04:36.934 --> 00:04:39.033
an eight-part series
on dinosaurs,

00:04:39.033 --> 00:04:41.234
called "Surviving Earth."

00:04:41.234 --> 00:04:42.868
Spoiler alert -- they don't.

00:04:42.868 --> 00:04:49.467
[ Laughter ]

00:04:49.467 --> 00:04:53.634
Hey, I heard that the Academy of
Motion Picture Arts and Sciences

00:04:53.634 --> 00:04:57.167
just invited
397 new members to join.

00:04:57.167 --> 00:04:58.767
Yeah, it's pretty exciting.

00:04:58.767 --> 00:05:00.467
One of the new members said...

00:05:00.467 --> 00:05:03.868
-[ Gibberish ]

00:05:03.868 --> 00:05:05.834
-While the other 396
were like...

00:05:05.834 --> 00:05:08.667
[ Gibberish ]

00:05:08.667 --> 00:05:09.734
-Pbht!

00:05:09.734 --> 00:05:11.367
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:11.367 --> 00:05:14.934
-Unbelievable.

00:05:14.934 --> 00:05:16.467
Well --
Well, this is fun.

00:05:16.467 --> 00:05:18.767
I saw that "Back to the Future:
The Musical"

00:05:18.767 --> 00:05:22.167
is set to debut on Broadway
in 2023, yeah.

00:05:22.167 --> 00:05:23.667
That's pretty big news,
and if you're wondering

00:05:23.667 --> 00:05:26.501
what it'd be like, we got our
hands on a sneak preview.

00:05:26.501 --> 00:05:27.601
Take a look.

00:05:27.601 --> 00:05:29.934
♪♪

00:05:29.934 --> 00:05:31.467
-♪ Doc ♪

00:05:31.467 --> 00:05:33.868
♪ You're my only hope ♪

00:05:33.868 --> 00:05:37.300
♪♪

00:05:37.300 --> 00:05:39.133
-♪ This is it ♪

00:05:39.133 --> 00:05:41.567
♪ This is the answer ♪

00:05:41.567 --> 00:05:43.200
♪ It says here ♪

00:05:43.200 --> 00:05:45.133
♪ A bolt of lightning is gonna
strike the clock tower ♪

00:05:45.133 --> 00:05:48.033
♪ Precisely at 10:04 p.m.
next Saturday night ♪

00:05:48.033 --> 00:05:49.434
♪ Hm-hm, ha ha ♪

00:05:49.434 --> 00:05:51.534
♪ Ha ha, hm-hm hm-hm ♪

00:05:51.534 --> 00:05:53.501
♪ Next Saturday night ♪

00:05:53.501 --> 00:05:56.534
♪ We're sending you
back to the future ♪

00:05:56.534 --> 00:05:58.234
-Whoa!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:58.234 --> 00:06:00.234
Bravo!

00:06:00.234 --> 00:06:05.767
Bravo!
[ Applause continues ]

00:06:05.767 --> 00:06:08.601
And, finally,
Air New Zealand has announced

00:06:08.601 --> 00:06:11.801
that they are adding the world's
first lie-flat pods

00:06:11.801 --> 00:06:13.400
to economy class.

00:06:13.400 --> 00:06:15.501
Here they are.
This is real.

00:06:15.501 --> 00:06:16.834
[ Audience "Oohs" ]

00:06:16.834 --> 00:06:19.267
Now the guy who hogs the armrest
will be spooning you.

00:06:19.267 --> 00:06:22.167
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:06:22.167 --> 00:06:23.801
Wow.

